  "description": "A high-performance, decentralized 3D engine and virtual world platform built on the Matrix protocol, forked from Third Room. It implements a multi-threaded architecture using bitECS for state management, Three.js for rendering, and Rapier3D for physics, synchronized across federated nodes. The system features a programmable scripting runtime (WebSG) powered by QuickJS and WebAssembly, enabling rich interactivity within cryptographically verified spatial environments.",
